{"originalLanguage":"ko","title":"타임캡슐","artist":"다비치","date":"2026-09-08","sourceId":"15101264:022","sourceHash":"950eee2da68986b57716596e11b53f71b0f53a972311fffe0e966bd4817c9751","duration":57.6,"cues":[{"id":"1","start":12.45,"end":18.8,"text":"어디까지 갔나요","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"2","start":18.9,"end":22.6,"text":"또 어떤 어른이 됐나요","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"3","start":22.92,"end":27.6,"text":"언젠가 내가 마주할 아주 먼 미래의 넌","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"4","start":27.69,"end":32.4,"text":"그 꿈을 이루나요 난","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"5","start":32.74,"end":34.9,"text":"어디 쯤에 온 걸까","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"6","start":35.01,"end":41.3,"text":"나도 모르고 왔단 말이야","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"7","start":41.38,"end":43.9,"text":"언제나 뭔갈 되뇌던 아주 먼 과거의 기억","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"8","start":44.08,"end":47.5,"text":"어떤 꿈을 꿨던 걸까 난","translation":"","kind":"lyric"}],"candidates":[],"reviewStatus":"draft"}